.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# The transcripts a run writes beside its results, carried out of a CI run as
# an artifact rather than committed. Named exactly, because the earlier
# transcripts*/ also swallowed runner/fixtures/transcripts, so the recorded
# calibration fixtures were silently never committed and the selftest that
# reads them would have found nothing and passed.
transcripts_on/
transcripts_off/
/scoreboard/transcripts/
